<!--Post: 11869--><!--Time: 1111305214-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11869"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 19, 2005 - 11:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Number 8 was not.&#34; <BR>From &#39;Oh Anna Why Didn&#39;t You Appear&#39; poem sent to intended victim Anna Williams by BTK June 15, 1979. <BR> <BR>The Sheep or The Lamb is the eighth sign of Chinese zodiac. <BR> <BR>Anna Williams was not intended to be murder victim number 8. BTK didn&#39;t mean eight in reference to us assuming that he had already killed seven people and Anna would have been the eighth. <BR> He was refering to the zodiac which inspired his secret symbol. <BR> <BR>In other words, One of my sheep she was not.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11869-->
<!--Post: 11884--><!--Time: 1111352457-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11884"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 20, 2005 - 1:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Wow, Johno, the more I hear about Zodiac, the more I see the connection.  Rader truly was the &#34;Bad Shepherd&#34;.   Have there been any other &#34;students&#34; of Zodiac?  I guess I&#39;m wondering how common it is for serial killers to emulate each other in some sort of an evil fraternity.  Maybe there&#39;s no such thing as a &#34;copycat&#34; - that these guys just naturally do it, and when we say &#34;copycat&#34;, it&#39;s almost more reflective of our disgust in their mutual self-admiration, than it is in saying that one of them is less inventive than another, and therefore &#34;less&#34; of an SK.  Maybe the original ones are the atypical ones. <BR> <BR>Thanks, Ember.  I do think it&#39;s ironic that he was born and captured in a Rooster year.  A &#34;cocky&#34; rooster, clucking and crowing at the media, does seem to be his symbol, and the lamb &#40;sheep&#41; does befit the innocent victims.  Wouldn&#39;t you know it, I&#39;m a monkey - with all those &#34;monkey issues&#34;.  As a geek and a Christian, I don&#39;t put too much stock in this astrological stuff, but it&#39;s rather weird how it fits sometimes. <BR> <BR>I wonder, when more of Rader&#39;s communications are eventually released, if there will be more lamb and sheep references that will bolster this interpretation of his symbol.  It wouldn&#39;t surprise me.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11884-->
<!--Post: 11889--><!--Time: 1111358629-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11889"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 20, 2005 - 2:43 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Johno and Pax, I am greatful that someone else has started realizing the importance of the Zodiac as it fits to Rader, Zodiac, The Night Stalker, I have something of worth to you both on this matter, yet it is to long to post, mail me asap for the link<!--/Text--></td></tr>
