<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12596"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 02, 2005 - 11:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->HuffDog! <BR> <BR>I am looking forward to your take on ìNightmareî. <BR>Crime writing is a dubious genre. I am wading in cautiously. <BR> <BR>My hunger for new information is being quashed by nauseaÖ but Iíll read on. <BR> <BR>Ö <BR> <BR>I just proofread my previous post. <BR> <BR>Looks like I could use a bitch-slapping from my sixth grade English teacher and a cup of strong black coffee. <BR> <BR>Good thing thereís no more liquor in the house! <BR> <BR>Ö <BR> <BR>Your post on the power that pop nomenclature gives to evil was sublime. <BR> <BR>I thought of you when I thought of this: <BR> <BR>&#34;Denny the Doggerel Hatcher&#34;  <BR> <BR>Ö <BR> <BR>Hey, did you notice the ìblaringî discrepancy between T.V.ís Otero Case letter and Mr. Beattieís? <BR> <BR>S.O.B. took the boyís radio AND left a purposely left a bloody Redwing wannabe cop boot print. <BR> <BR>I have half of a post undergoing fermentation right now. <BR> <BR>It addresses the Doggerel Hatcherís own fermentation in the bacteria of mid-century media and pop culture. <BR> <BR>Similarities between the Clutter murders and the Otero killings are grist for the mill. <BR> <BR>Watch the DVD of ìIn Cold Bloodî if you havenít seen it recently. <BR>Aside from itís relevance to Raderís transformation, it is a terribly well-crafted film. <BR> <BR>Rich black and white cinematography by the great Conrad Hall, slam bang editing and ballsy performances nearly overshadow the hideous storyline. <BR>Ultimately the style compliments the subject matter and ñ as George noted many weeks ago ñ the compliment may have been much too effective for Raderís id. <BR> <BR>OH, JEEZ!... I forgotÖ his thread is about the ìsymbolîÖ OKÖ UmmmÖ sorryÖ howís this <BR> <BR>Ö turn it upside down and it looks like two tombstones and a TV antennaÖ no?... <BR> <BR>How about a babyís arm holding an apple?... I knowÖ I knowÖ <BR> <BR>Donít drink and post! <BR> <BR>MADDdog <BR> <BR> <BR>   <BR>  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12596-->
<!--Post: 12602--><!--Time: 1112544513-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12602"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 03, 2005 - 9:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Will someone with the book please post the <BR>&#34;blaring&#34; differences between toms letter and <BR>beattie&#39;s letter? i guess you should post in under &#34;the entire otero letter&#34;. <BR>thanks!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12602-->
<!--Post: 12610--><!--Time: 1112554629-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12610"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 03, 2005 - 11:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I guess we can say Denny was a &#34;typical male&#34; in this fact.....BOOBS.  <BR> <BR>OMG Dogg....was that you sitting next to me in class with the doodling Pee Chee....only it wasn&#39;t always on the inside cover! <BR> <BR>I think we can say he isn&#39;t the only one. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
