<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12617"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bmodule<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 03, 2005 - 8:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><i>I believe you have found something very helpful. Asanawa, meaning Hemp. I believe he was living out his Sick Ideas.</i>  <BR> <BR>...Did I mention that there was 4000 lb of hemp on the plane that crashed in Florida...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
